#!/bin/sh
# sqlgraph 실행 스크립트 (Linux / macOS). 함께 들어 있는 Java 런타임으로 실행한다.
SELF="$0"
while [ -h "$SELF" ]; do
  LINK=$(readlink "$SELF")
  case "$LINK" in
    /*) SELF="$LINK" ;;
    *) SELF="$(dirname "$SELF")/$LINK" ;;
  esac
done
APP_HOME=$(cd "$(dirname "$SELF")/.." && pwd -P)
exec "$APP_HOME/runtime/bin/java" --enable-native-access=ALL-UNNAMED \
  -Dstdout.encoding=UTF-8 -Dstderr.encoding=UTF-8 \
  -jar "$APP_HOME/lib/sqlgraph-mcp.jar" "$@"
